Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 20:04:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] [llvmcpu] add beforeLowerToLLVMHook

Also skip contract lowering in functions with a Zvt-shaped
vector.contract when the target has +zvtbase (the CoralNPU plugin
then lowers every contraction there), and add a
createConvolutionToIGEMMPass(configFn, controlFn) factory that
forwards both callbacks.
